*Key Formula:*
- *Tangent Plane to $f(x,y,z) = c$ at $P(x_0, y_0, z_0)$: *
  $ (partial f) / (partial x) (P)(x - x_0) + (partial f) / (partial y) (P)(y - y_0) + (partial f) / (partial z) (P)(z - z_0) = 0 $
